      "Record the role, shift length, notice period, required credentials. Whether the absence was planned or unplanned. These fields create strata because a two-hour notice for a credentialed role is not comparable to a week of notice for a general admin shift. Use the shift identifier plus date as the stable key and note any reassignment that changed the original unit.",
