      "Draw the sample from the absence and scheduling exports, including shifts that were never filled. Record the export date, filters, and the rule used to select cases. If the site has seasonal peaks, sample across more than one week or state the seasonal limitation. A sample drawn only from difficult cases can describe the escalation path but not the ordinary fill time.",
      "Collect timestamps from the systems that recorded them at the time. If a timestamp exists only in a chat thread, mark it as fragile and note the retention limit. Do not infer a start time from the first reply if the absence was reported earlier by phone. The collection note should say which timestamps were authoritative and which were reconstructed.",
      "## Analysis and reporting",
