    "slug": "philippines-assignment-end-access-review-research",
    "title": "What does an assignment-end access review actually catch?",
    "excerpt": "A protocol for verifying access removal after a Philippines-based assignment ends, including inventory completeness, residual findings, and time-to-verification.",
    "published": "2026-11-03",
