      "## What the result can change",
      "The result can change the intake template, the pre-submission check, or the routing of exception requests. It cannot prove that a particular client was careless or that an account manager failed. The protocol describes the request record and the rework it created, not the intentions of the people involved.",
      "If the same field is missing across clients, the template or the explanation may be unclear. If the problem is concentrated in one client, address it through the account relationship. A global process change is not the right response to a local communication problem.",
      "## A worked reporting example",
